# {{projectName}} multiplatform app

Shared Compose UI targets Android, iOS, and desktop.

```bash
./gradlew :androidApp:assembleDebug
./gradlew :composeApp:run
```

`composeApp` contains the shared Android, iOS, and desktop UI. `androidApp` is the
Android application entry point; keeping it separate uses the supported Android
Gradle Plugin 9 Kotlin Multiplatform project structure.

For iOS, run `xcodegen generate --spec iosApp/project.yml`, then open
`iosApp/BetterFullstackIOS.xcodeproj`. The Xcode target builds and embeds the shared
`ComposeApp` framework before each application build.
